  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If for some positive integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, the coefficients of three consecutive terms in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> are in the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>14</mn></math>, then the largest coefficient in the expansion is :",
    "image": null
